<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt has issued call and put warrants, in 19 equal tranches, on the CAC 40 index, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>The warrants can be exercised between February 17, 1997 and March 19, 1998 apart from three tranches that mature on October 19, 1998.</p>
<p>There is a minimum exercise of 10,000 warrants. They will be listed in Paris, denominated in French francs with a pay date of February 17, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
